  metadata in this file.
title: 3char-pipeline
type: software
version: "0.1.2"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
authors:
  - name: "Brenner Viana Cruvinel"
    given-names: Brenner
    family-names: Viana Cruvinel
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3079-8829
    affiliation: Hoff Research
    website: https://hoffresearch.com
abstract: >-
  Build pipeline for the 3char dataset: 64 parsers that read code lists published by their assigning
  authorities and emit one Parquet file per system in a common schema, with per-system provenance,
  license triage, a regex enforced at build time, checksums of every raw source, and the scripts that
  reproduce the statistics in the dataset card. The dataset itself is cited by its release DOI.
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/brennercruvinel/3char-pipeline
url: https://huggingface.co/datasets/brennercruvinel/3char
keywords:
  - code systems
  - identifiers
  - controlled vocabularies
  - provenance
  - data pipeline
  - parquet
